// `NounPhrase.Agree` under Lean's own name for it: the alias
// `declare_semantic_primitives` generates, so a card writes a macro where the
// basis has a constructor (ADR 12.1). An Agreement: the members of the group
// share, or do not share, a value on the axis ("two creatures that share a
// creature type"), a constraint on the selection, not a predicate on one member.
(
    name: "agree",
    kinds: [NounPhrase],
    params: {"axis": Any, "agreement": Any, "group": Subject},
    body: Agree(axis: Param(axis), agreement: Param(agreement), group: Param(group)),
)
